  "prefLabel": "Plc 1808.02 Ethical Standards",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1808.02 Ethical Standards. Individuals who are subject to this chapter shall:\n\n(a) Adhere to all applicable standards of the USPAP as defined in Plc 1802.38; and\n\n(b) Be subject to:\n\n(1) The IAAO ethical standards dated July 2021 as adopted by the NHAAO, available at https://www.nhaao.org/governing-documents and as noted in Appendix B; and\n\n(2) Any NH-specific ethical standards adopted in rules pursuant to the procedures in RSA 541-A by the ASB.\n\nSource. #14330, eff 9-22-25, EXPIRES: 9-22-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1800.html"
